{"id":"c86c862e709fb95d","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-stratification.md","title":"Stratification","display":"df-stratification — Stratification","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stratification","aliases":["58-df-stratification","Stratification"],"display":"df-stratification — Stratification","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stratification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stratification</span><span>Stratification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stratification — Stratification"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> is a topological space, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal S:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_\\alpha=\\mathcal S(\\alpha)\">\\(S_\\alpha=\\mathcal S(\\alpha)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stratification}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stratification}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> denotes the locally finite topological stratification defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stratification}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stratification}_S(\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal S:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}S_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\in I\\;(S_\\alpha\\cap S_\\beta=\\emptyset)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\exists U,C\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(U\\in\\tau\\land X\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\land S_\\alpha=U\\cap C\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left[\nx\\in U\\land\n\\left|\\{\\alpha\\in I:U\\cap S_\\alpha\\neq\\emptyset\\}\\right|&lt;\\omega\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(\nS_\\alpha\\cap\\overline{S_\\beta}^{\\,X}\\neq\\emptyset\n\\to S_\\alpha\\subseteq\\overline{S_\\beta}^{\\,X}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stratification}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stratification}_S(\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal S:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}S_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\in I\\;(S_\\alpha\\cap S_\\beta=\\emptyset)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\exists U,C\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(U\\in\\tau\\land X\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\land S_\\alpha=U\\cap C\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left[\nx\\in U\\land\n\\left|\\{\\alpha\\in I:U\\cap S_\\alpha\\neq\\emptyset\\}\\right|&lt;\\omega\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(\nS_\\alpha\\cap\\overline{S_\\beta}^{\\,X}\\neq\\emptyset\n\\to S_\\alpha\\subseteq\\overline{S_\\beta}^{\\,X}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Local finiteness, locally closed strata, and the frontier condition belong to this topological base notion.</li>\n<li>A Whitney stratification additionally requires an ambient smooth structure, smooth strata, tangent-space limits, and secant-line limits.  Those data are not supplied by the cited topological dependencies, so no unsourced Whitney predicate is introduced here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Goresky and MacPherson, Stratified Morse Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)$ is from [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"S_\\alpha=\\mathcal S(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stratification}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stratification}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stratification}_S(\\mathcal S,I,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathcal S:I\\to\\mathcal P(X)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in I}S_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\in I\\;(S_\\alpha\\cap S_\\beta=\\emptyset)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in I\\;\\exists U,C\\subseteq X\\;\n\\bigl(U\\in\\tau\\land X\\setminus C\\in\\tau\\land S_\\alpha=U\\cap C\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left[\nx\\in U\\land\n\\left|\\{\\alpha\\in I:U\\cap S_\\alpha\\neq\\emptyset\\}\\right|<\\omega\n\\right]\n\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in I\\;\n\\bigl(\nS_\\alpha\\cap\\overline{S_\\beta}^{\\,X}\\neq\\emptyset\n\\to S_\\alpha\\subseteq\\overline{S_\\beta}^{\\,X}\n\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1827,"backlinks":[{"id":"9cc3cffe81d4e71b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-stratification.md|58-df-stratification]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}